 "structural_change": "S81-TOPK7 HIERARCHICAL QUARTER (OT_S81PH_SEL_HQ, dsfd_selt_q_hq): structural successor of the monolithic succ3/succ4/succ4k8/sq_reg/OMERGE family (mapped native census FAIL 741 drivers > 32, rst_n 10,760; evidence 89ba149e4). Same ports / function / every edge (0 added cycles): reset landed by the kit in 2 balanced stages (8 first / 128 final kept copies, <=32 loads) with no reset on datapath registers; histograms = 16 instances of the hardened hist32 bank (TOPK5 R3, gate PASS max25); packers as 6 bit planes with per-plane select copies; every wide select a registered one-hot AND-OR with kept copies (r1_d, o0, pend, mem_wdata); seg_clr / rem / sw_seg / head-full / bound / sign / command copies; per-depth-bank SRAM write-data registers (wd_in launched beside its macros). Clock: K16 regional roots as succ4.",
